---
# cordanaLLM/praetor High-Integrity Systems Standard (HISS)
# Clang-Tidy Configuration
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*,
  modernize-*,
  performance-*,
  readability-*,
  -readability-identifier-length

WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*'
FormatStyle: file
...
